    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">The novel (Joanou) takes the reader through thrilling, captivating events that begin in (Egypt) and end in (Malaysia), which is considered the main theater of events. The novel combines romance with excitement and suspense, and extends multiple dramatic lines in an exciting format, whose heroes are Egyptians and Malaysians of different races and religions. The novel also exposes some cultures that may be shocking to the reader, but it derives its spirit from imagination in order to describe some of reality.</marc:subfield>
